5em;box-sizing:border-box;font-size:1em;border:1px solid #ccc;border-radius:6px}input[type=file]{padding:.3em 0;border:0}input[type=checkbox]{width:auto;margin-right:.45em}.checkline{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.35em;margin-top:.8em}button{margin-top:.9em;padding:.6em 1em;background:#2f6f5e;color:#fff;border:0;border-radius:6px;cursor:pointer}button.danger{background:#b3261e}code{font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,monospace;background:#f3f3f3;padding:.1em .35em;border-radius:4px}@media (max-width:640px){body{padding:0 .75em}}</style></head><body>␀␀<h2>␀␀␀␀</h2>␀␀␀<div class='summary'><p><strong>mDNS</strong> ␀␀.local</p>␀␀<p><strong>IP</strong> ␀<p><strong>Interface</strong> ␀␀</p><p><strong>Current connection</strong> ␀</p><div class='chips'><span class='chip'>␀␀</span><span class='chip'>␀␀</span></div><p class='m'><a href='/stats'>View stats page</a></p></div>␀␀␀␀<details open><summary>OTA Update</summary><div class='inside'><p>Upload an app-only <code>firmware.bin</code> over the LAN.</p><form method='POST' action='/update' enctype='multipart/form-data'><input type='file' name='firmware' accept='.bin' required><br><button type='submit'>Upload firmware.bin</button></form><p class='m'>CLI alternative: <code>curl -u admin:&lt;password&gt; -F firmware=@firmware.bin http://␀␀.local/update</code></p></div></details>␀␀␀␀<details><summary>Hostname</summary><div class='inside'><p>Controls the mDNS / OTA hostname the modem advertises on the network.</p><form method='POST' action='/hostname'><label>mDNS / OTA hostname</label>␀␀␀<input type='text' name='hostname' autocomplete='off' maxlength='32' value='␀␀␀␀' placeholder='leave blank for default'>␀␀␀␀<button type='submit'>Save hostname</button></form><p class='m'>Blank resets to the board default. Reboot required.</p></div></details>␀<details><summary>Network</summary><div class='inside'><p>␀␀</p><form method='POST' action='/network'><div class='checkline'><input type='checkbox' id='static' name='static' value='1'␀><label for='static'>Use static IP instead of DHCP</label></div><div class='grid'>␀␀ checked␀␀␀␀<div><label>Static IP</label><input type='text' name='ip' value='␀␀␀' placeholder='192.168.1.42'></div>␀<div><label>Subnet mask</label><input type='text' name='sn' value='␀' placeholder='255.255.255.0'></div>␀␀␀␀<div><label>Gateway</label><input type='text' name='gw' value='␀' placeholder='192.168.1.1'></div>␀␀<div><label>DNS 1</label><input type='text' name='dns1' value='␀' placeholder='1.1.1.1'></div>␀␀<div><label>DNS 2</label><input type='text' name='dns2' value='␀' placeholder='8.8.8.8'></div>␀␀<div><label>Current source</label><div class='chip'>␀␀␀␀</div></div>␀␀␀␀<button type='submit'>Save network settings</button></form></div></details>␀<div class='checkline'><input type='checkbox' id='wifi_ant_ext' name='wifi_ant_ext' value='1'␀␀␀><label for='wifi_ant_ext'>Use external Wi-Fi antenna</label></div>␀<details open><summary>Heltec V4.3 RF Front-End</summary><div class='inside'><p>Toggle the KCT8103L external RX LNA for receive only. The firmware always bypasses the FEM LNA during transmit so the TX path remains available.</p><form method='POST' action='/rf-lna'><div class='checkline'><input type='checkbox' id='v43_lna_on' name='v43_lna_on' value='1'␀␀><label for='v43_lna_on'>Enable external FEM RX LNA</label></div>␀␀␀<label>agc.reset.interval (seconds, 0 disables)<input name='agc_reset_interval_sec' type='number' min='0' max='3600' step='1' value='␀␀␀'></label><p class='m'>Periodically restarts RX gain control during long idle periods to prevent strong out-of-band interference from clamping the noise floor.</p><button type='submit'>Save RF front-end settings</button></form><p class='m'>Settings apply immediately and persist across reboots. Unchecked LNA = GPIO5/CTX HIGH, external LNA bypassed.</p></div></details>␀␀␀<details open><summary>Station G3 RF Front-End</summary><div class='inside'><p>Configure the Station G3 PA level on GPIO9 and receive-only external LNA on GPIO10.</p><form method='POST' action='/rf-pa'><div class='checkline'><input type='checkbox' id='g3_pa_high' name='g3_pa_high' value='1'␀><label for='g3_pa_high'>Enable higher PA mode</label></div><div class='checkline'><input type='checkbox' id='g3_lna_on' name='g3_lna_on' value='1'␀><label for='g3_lna_on'>Enable Station G3 external RX LNA</label></div><button type='submit'>Save RF front-end settings</button></form><p class='m'>The external LNA is receive-only and is always bypassed before transmit. Disable it when local RF noise reduces SNR.</p><p class='m'><strong>RF safety:</strong> remove the PA PL1 and LNA P jumpers for GPIO control. PA PL2 remains a physical jumper. Higher PA mode can produce substantially more antenna power; use a suitable antenna/load and comply with regional limits. The lower PA mode is the default.</p></div></details>␀␀␀␀<details><summary>openHop Token</summary><div class='inside'><p>This token must match the <code>token</code> value in openHop so openHop can connect to the radio.</p><form method='POST' action='/token'><label>New openHop token</label><input type='password' name='token' autocomplete='new-password' maxlength='64'><label>Confirm openHop token</label><input type='password' name='confirm' autocomplete='new-password' maxlength='64'><button type='submit'>Save openHop token</button></form><p class='m'>Current mode: <span class='chip'>␀␀␀␀<details open><summary>GPS</summary><div class='inside'><p>Turn the onboard GPS receiver interface on only when location data is needed. Default is off to save battery.</p><form method='POST' action='/gps'><div class='checkline'><input type='checkbox' id='gps_enabled' name='gps_enabled' value='1'␀␀␀><label for='gps_enabled'>Enable GPS</label></div><button type='submit'>Save GPS setting</button></form><p class='m'>Applies immediately and persists across reboots.</p></div></details>␀␀␀</span>. Leave both fields blank to clear it. Reboot required.</p></div></details>␀␀<details><summary>HTTP Password</summary><div class='inside'><p>Protects this web page and OTA uploads. Username: <code>admin</code>.</p><form method='POST' action='/auth'><label>New password</label><input type='password' name='password' autocomplete='new-password' required minlength='1' maxlength='64'><label>Confirm password</label><input type='password' name='confirm' autocomplete='new-password' required minlength='1' maxlength='64'><button type='submit'>Save password</button></form><p class='m'>Password changes take effect on the next request.</p></div></details>␀␀␀␀<details><summary>Wi-Fi Setup Mode</summary><div class='inside'><p>Clear the saved modem configuration and reboot into the open <code>openHop-Modem-XXXX</code> setup AP.</p><form method='POST' action='/wifi-reset' onsubmit="return confirm('Clear saved modem configuration and reboot into Wi-Fi setup AP?');"><button class='danger' type='submit'>Enter Wi-Fi Setup Mode</button></form><p class='m'>Use this before moving the modem to a different Wi-Fi network.</p></div></details>␀␀<details><summary>Reboot</summary><div class='inside'><p>Restart the modem without changing any settings.</p><form method='POST' action='/reboot'><button type='submit'>Reboot modem</button></form></div></details></body></html>␀␀waiting␀no fix␀␀On␀␀Off␀Higher␀␀Lower␀␀␀Enabled␀Bypassed␀␀␀␀Detected␀␀␀␀Not detected␀␀␀␀Static␀␀DHCP␀␀␀␀External␀␀␀␀Internal␀␀␀␀<!DOCTYPE html><html><head><meta charset='utf-8'><meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width,initial-scale=1'><meta http-equiv='refresh' content='5'><title>Modem Stats</title><style>body{font-family:system-ui,sans-serif;max-width:760px;margin:1.25em auto;padding:0 1em;color:#222;line-height:1.45}h2{margin:.2em 0 .35em}h3{margin:1.2em 0 .45em}.m{color:#666;font-size:.92em}.card{background:#f7f7f7;border:1px solid #ddd;border-radius:8px;padding:.8em 1em;margin:1em 0}.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(220px,1fr));gap:.75em 1em}.kv{border:1px solid #ddd;border-radius:8px;background:#fff;padding:.7em .8em}.k{display:block;color:#666;font-size:.9em;margin-bottom:.2em}.v{font-weight:600}.actions{margin:1em 0}.actions a{margin-right:1em}code{font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,monospace;background:#f3f3f3;padding:.1em .35em;border-radius:4px}@media (max-width:640px){body{padding:0 .75em}}</style></head><body>␀␀␀ Stats</h2>␀<div class='actions'><a href='/'>Back to main page</a></div>␀␀␀␀<p class='m'>Auto-refreshes every 5 seconds.</p>␀␀␀␀<div class='card'><div class='grid'>␀␀␀␀<div class='kv'><span class='k'>Firmware</span><span class='v'>␀<div class='kv'><span class='k'>Hostname</span><span class='v'>␀.local</span></div>␀<div class='kv'><span class='k'>Current IP</span><span class='v'>␀␀␀<div class='kv'><span class='k'>Connected client</span><span class='v'>␀<div class='kv'><span class='k'>Interface</span><span class='v'>␀␀␀␀<div class='kv'><span class='k'>Wi-Fi signal</span><span class='v'>␀ dBm</span></div>␀␀␀<div class='kv'><span class='k'>Uptime</span><span class='v'>␀␀␀<div class='kv'><span class='k'>Battery</span><span class='v'>␀␀ V</span></div>␀<div class='kv'><span class='k'>Battery charge rate</span><span class='v'>␀␀ %/hr␀␀␀unknown␀<div class='kv'><span class='k'>GPS fix</span><span class='v'>␀␀<div class='kv'><span class='k'>GPS location</span><span class='v'>␀<h3>Radio</h3><div class='grid'>␀␀␀␀<div class='kv'><span class='k'>State</span><span class='v'>␀␀␀␀<div class='kv'><span class='k'>Frequency</span><span class='v'>␀␀␀␀ MHz</span></div>␀␀␀<div class='kv'><span class='k'>Bandwidth</span><span class='v'>␀␀␀␀ kHz</span></div>␀␀␀<div class='kv'><span class='k'>Spreading factor</span><span class='v'>SF␀␀␀<div class='kv'><span class='k'>Coding rate</span><span class='v'>4/␀␀␀␀<div class='kv'><span class='k'>TX power</span><span class='v'>␀<div class='kv'><span class='k'>Syncword</span><span class='v'>0x␀␀␀<div class='kv'><span class='k'>Preamble</span><span class='v'>␀<div class='kv'><span class='k'>Auto CAD</span><span class='v'>␀<div class='kv'><span class='k'>Station G3 PA mode</span><span class='v'>␀␀␀<div class='kv'><span class='k'>Station G3 external RX LNA</span><span class='v'>␀␀␀<h3>Counters</h3><div class='grid'>␀<div class='kv'><span class='k'>RX packets</span><span class='v'>␀␀␀<div class='kv'><span class='k'>TX packets</span><span class='v'>␀␀␀<div class='kv'><span class='k'>CRC errors</span><span class='v'>␀␀␀<div class='kv'><span class='k'>Last RSSI</span><span class='v'>␀␀␀␀<div class='kv'><span class='k'>Last SNR</span><span class='v'>␀ dB</span></div>␀␀␀␀<div class='kv'><span class='k'>Noise floor</span><span class='v'>␀␀<div class='kv'><span class='k'>Die temperature</span><span class='v'>␀␀ C</span></div>␀<h3>Network</h3><div class='grid'>␀␀<h3>Station G3 Power</h3><div class='grid'>␀<div class='kv'><span class='k'>INA219 monitor</span><span class='v'>␀␀␀Current␀<div class='kv'><span class='k'>Reading state</span><span class='v'>␀␀␀␀Read error␀␀<div class='kv'><span class='k'>Input voltage</span><span class='v'>␀␀␀␀<div class='kv'><span class='k'>Current</span><span class='v'>␀␀ mA</span></div>␀␀␀␀<div class='kv'><span class='k'>Power</span><span class='v'>␀␀␀␀ W</span></div>␀<div class='kv'><span class='k'>Minimum input voltage</span><span class='v'>␀␀␀␀<div class='kv'><span class='k'>Maximum current</span><span class='v'>␀␀<div class='kv'><span class='k'>Mode</span><span class='v'>␀<div class='kv'><span class='k'>Port</span><span class='v'>␀<div class='kv'><span class='k'>Wi-Fi RSSI</span><span class='v'>␀␀␀<div class='kv'><span class='k'>Wi-Fi antenna</span><span class='v'>␀␀␀␀<div class='kv'><span class='k'>Heltec V4.3 external LNA</span><span class='v'>␀<div class='kv'><span class='k'>Gateway</span><span class='v'>␀␀<div class='kv'><span class='k'>Subnet</span><span class='v'>␀␀␀<div class='kv'><span class='k'>DNS 1</span><span class='v'>␀␀␀␀<div class='kv'><span class='k'>DNS 2</span><span class='v'>␀␀␀␀</div></body></html>␀␀␀␀cleared␀The modem will reboot now and